  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...8...10 spirit. If a non-spirit creature within range dies, Edge of Extinction deals 14...43...50 damage to all creatures of the same type that are below 90% Health and within range of the spirit. This spirit dies after 30...198...240 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "創造一隻等級 1～10 的滅絕精靈。每當區域內有生物死亡時，在滅絕精靈範圍內體力低於 90 %的同種類生物將受到 14～50 傷害。滅絕精靈在 30～240 秒後消失。"
    },
    "pvp": null
